### PR Description

Improving invitation filters on the admin invitation page, where the admin can filter invitations that have invitees with a specific role and invitations with a specific status.

### Description of tasks that were expected to be completed

- Improving invitation filters
- Update both backend and frontend for the best filtering experience
- Define schema for filter

### Functionality

This filter, takes role and status input values and retrieve all invitations which meet with those inputs

### How has this been tested?

To test it you can send this query in Apollo server or studio

```typescript
query filter {
  filterInvitations(role: "ttl", status: "pending") {
    invitations {
      invitees {
        email
        role
      }
      status
      id
    }
  }
}
```

Since we set the memory space after we set all the variable shapes and selections, the memory selection needs to be updated together with the variable shape.

```c++
